{"name": "Open Land", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Open Land</strong> is a cozy building and restoration game about healing a broken world with the help of friendly eco-technology. Clean up pollution, recycle debris, and guide nature back to life as barren land slowly transforms into a thriving ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You begin in a damaged landscape filled with trash, oil, and scorched ground. With only a small eco-bot and a handful of tools, you start restoring the land one action at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"60\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/36ef63690cc23d7743016ca894cb3e3a.webp?t=1787741250\" width=\"600\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/91bb2c51ed3f291ff59a74c2101a0b14.poster.avif?t=1787741250\" width=\"1100\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/91bb2c51ed3f291ff59a74c2101a0b14.webm?t=1787741250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/91bb2c51ed3f291ff59a74c2101a0b14.mp4?t=1787741250\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place plants, structures, and restoration tools to shape the land. As conditions improve, nature responds. Grass cascades across the terrain, trees take root, and the ecosystem begins to sustain itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"60\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/afe7e06a43f38271661aababd7118812.webp?t=1787741250\" width=\"600\"/></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/b61da50533f980784a57a7e0102094b0.poster.avif?t=1787741250\" width=\"1100\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/b61da50533f980784a57a7e0102094b0.webm?t=1787741250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/b61da50533f980784a57a7e0102094b0.mp4?t=1787741250\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As the land recovers, animals return. Different species thrive under different conditions, and their presence reflects the health of the ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create safe, balanced habitats and watch animals explore, interact, and settle into the world you\u2019ve restored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"60\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/784acff69736c087924e8e4495b56fda.webp?t=1787741250\" width=\"600\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"400\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/6622ac37352e11eca595531eae140fa6.poster.avif?t=1787741250\" width=\"1100\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/6622ac37352e11eca595531eae140fa6.webm?t=1787741250\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/extras/6622ac37352e11eca595531eae140fa6.mp4?t=1787741250\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn eco points by cleaning, recycling, and restoring the land. Unlock new buildings, upgrades, and restoration technologies as each stage is completed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With every step forward, you gain new ways to clean faster, restore larger areas, and guide the ecosystem toward long-term sustainability.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Transform barren land into a thriving ecosystem in this relaxing building game. Recycle trash, grow plants, and reintroduce wildlife to create a self-sustaining world.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132310/43a5fa61f12a5b29b6152a3247d0439f47d60549/header.jpg?t=1787741250", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Cozy", "Building", "Sandbox", "Relaxing", "Simulation", "Nature"], "developers": "Ralph Schaedler", "publishers": "Ralph Schaedler", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4132310", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "29 April 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/FhBFqFZUKvU", "first_seen": 1777413600.0, "review_rank": 779}